cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: 'Metadata Mender: Reconciling Zotero item metadata against public bibliographic services'
abstract: Zotero 9+ plugin that reconciles and completes item metadata by looking up DOI, PMID, or CRAN
  package id against PubMed, OpenAlex, Crossref, Semantic Scholar, OpenAIRE, Unpaywall, CORE, and CRAN;
  records citation count, an OpenAlex-based impact-factor surrogate, and any open-access PDF link.
authors:
- family-names: Heller
  given-names: Raban
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-08-11'
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/CTTIR/metadata-mender
url: https://cttir.github.io/metadata-mender/
keywords:
